WEBVTT

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.060
How odd...

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.700
That Miss Milka would drown.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.930
Perhaps she lost
her magical powers?

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.030
Magic?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.560
Does she really have magic?

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.160
But she...

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.760
It's true that
children have magic.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.230
All people have mysterious
powers when they're children.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.260
But that power wouldn't stop
your growth or anything like that.

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.000
It's more about being able
to see things that adults can't...

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.160
...or the ability to sense the world
around you with your whole body.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:32.630
Then why can't she grow?

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.730
Want some hot chocolate Seiren?

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.000
Don't change the subject!

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:41.130
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:45.230
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.460
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:52.560
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:59.500
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:06.360
...was the only truth there was.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:14.200
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:23.660
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.560
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.700
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:40.460
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:44.400
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:50.400
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:55.360
I'll keep searching for you.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:15.100
Hatsumi

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.060
It's all because you came here!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.600
It's always this way, you
bring bad luck wherever you go!

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.630
Do you know me by
any chance, Seiren?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.330
Give me a break!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.530
Have we met before?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.360
Seiren is a magical creature
you brought into existence...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.260
...and then forgot about, Lilith.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.100
A magical creature?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.900
Who the hell are you?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.760
Anyway, she holds a
huge grudge against Lilith.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:51.560
It appears her plan was to
control Milka and use her magic.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.430
Oh, is that so?

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.430
How could you?

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.960
Okay, you can get
even with me if you want.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.200
Do you wanna slap me?

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:10.160
I know you made that
woman go away, right Rascalas?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:15.830
You've always been
a best friend to me.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:22.230
But... I'm okay now.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:32.160
Next time anyone tries to bully me,
I'll try to handle it myself.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.830
So...

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:40.530
I don't want you to do scary things
like that for me anymore, Rascalas.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.760
I'll be okay.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:49.060
But if I'm ever in really big
trouble, then you can help me.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:57.730
I don't know why but I
feel really good right now.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.330
Maybe it's because
Hazuki and Lilith are here.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.830
Is this good bye?

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:12.660
Yes, and Seiren will leave soon
after she's done packing her stuff.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.660
Am I going to be all alone?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.430
No.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:19.760
We'll leave this ship for you,
so you and Rascalas can travel...

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.900
...to the land beyond the ocean.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.000
Beyond the ocean...

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.100
There will be
something good for you there.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.630
Where are you going?

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.260
I'm going to fix the periperi.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:40.060
If I fix periperi, then you
can grow up to be a real lady.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:40.830
Bye-bye!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.460
Periperi, periperi...

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.700
No!

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.400
I am going to fix this now.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.660
You're so cold-blooded.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.630
You forgot all about me.

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:17.300
For god sake, please
give me something to eat.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.760
This story is about
the time when Hazuki...

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.730
...still lived in the
land called Japan.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:36.660
And now for
today's horoscope: Leo!

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.030
Your health and emotions
will be excellent today!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.960
Send a text message to
a person you have a crush on...

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.530
...and you'll get closer to them!

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:43.960
Your lucky color is yellow!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.960
Your lucky object is toast!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.900
You'll have a lot of luck today!

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.130
Well, I guess that makes sense.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.460
Good morning, Hatsumi.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.730
Do you want to go to
the park next Sunday?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.500
They have a swimming pool.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.360
You can't? I see.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.030
Oh well, that's too bad.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.130
You're going out with... a man?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.400
Hatsumi, you're leaving already?

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.060
I'm coming too!

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:32.860
I'll be back later!

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:44.900
Found her.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:51.930
Um...

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:54.560
I see you on
this train every day.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.760
By the way, my
name is Yamaguchi.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:04.100
If it's okay, would you give
me your cell phone number?

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:06.860
Really?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:19.530
Hatsumi!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.260
You're too nice to everybody.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:28.260
You're going to have guys after you
if you don't stop that, don't you agree?

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:38.400
When did you get it? For me?

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.930
St. Feminine Girls School

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:57.400
Miss Azuma, please forgive
me for sending you this letter.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:05.800
I don't want to reveal my name
until I know if you like me or not.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:12.430
I've admired you since the first
time I saw you enter this school.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:19.100
That's because... I've always
wanted an older sister like you.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.160
You were the
embodiment of that ideal.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.600
Wow, Azuma! You're awesome!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.260
Ha-tsu-mi.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.930
I like everybody.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:21.800
But the one I like
the most is you, Hazuki.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.060
Good night.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.930
No, it's not like that, Hatsumi.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.730
I want to be the one and only...

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:49.260
I need to be the
only one you love.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.460
Hatsumi, here.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:03.000
I want to hold you,
just hold you...

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:25.430
Hatsumi...

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.260
Were you singing just now?

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:36.260
Okay, it must be
my imagination then.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.700
That's a very nice comb,
is it an antique?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.260
Wow, very nice.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:10.330
If it's so painful living under the
same roof, I wish we were strangers.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:16.130
It's not like we're
related by blood or anything.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.830
St. Feminine Girls School

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.660
I'm in trouble!

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.330
That time of the
month came unexpectedly!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.000
Hazuki, can you spare me one?

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:57.730
Is your next class gymnastics?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.230
You're really clumsy, Hatsumi.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.530
Catch!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:14.600
Dear Miss Azuma, I still
haven't received a reply from you...

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.030
...so I decided to
write you another letter.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:24.630
I think it is such a miraculous
thing to fall in love with someone.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:33.430
And if you hate me for writing
this letter, I will really feel hurt.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.930
I wonder what is this feeling?

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.700
It's Hatsumi.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.900
Have you decided where we
should go on our next date?

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:50.300
I want to see the movie
"Melquiades Strikes Back."

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.730
What do you think?

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.860
Hatsumi, are you going out?

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:15.000
Where are you going?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.460
Isn't that skirt too short?

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.630
That is okay!?

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.200
No, it's not!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:39.360
Hatsumi's scent... very nice.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.130
I understand.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:07.360
I'm only healthy now because
Hatsumi took care of me...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.060
...when I was so young and frail.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:15.130
Her warm feelings
always wrapped around me.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:19.530
It's not just some kind gesture,
it was actual, unconditional love.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.030
It hurts!

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:27.330
Hazuki, it's gonna be fine.

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:45.130
I made hotcakes
in homemaking class,...

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:48.400
...but they were so bad
nobody could eat them!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.360
It's okay, make them.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:55.060
It can't be that bad.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.400
Whatever you cook,
let me taste it, okay?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:22.830
These hotcakes are so
angelic, just like Hatsumi.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:29.960
I love you so
much, that's why I...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.930
I'm disgusting.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.300
Hatsumi!

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:39.030
Hatsumi, what should I do?

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:44.930
When Hazuki is
sad, I'm sad, too.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:08.730
It may seem sudden,...

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:12.660
...but I think this is the last
letter I'll write to you, dear sister.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.160
I do still adore you, dear sister.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:19.900
No, I even love you more than ever.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:23.900
But I understand there
are some kinds of love...

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:28.130
...that can never
be true in this world.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:32.930
So, I've decided to keep you in
my heart as an object of affection,...

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:34.830
...for eternity.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:40.330
I'm so sorry for writing such
random, selfish thoughts to you.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.500
Now let's look at
the horoscope of Leo!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.100
Your health is fragile.

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:00.300
Try to pay attention
or you could get hurt.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.500
Your unlucky color is black.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.860
Your unlucky object is a comb.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:06.960
How stupid.

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:08.800
Good morning.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.200
It's fine.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.300
This will do for now.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:21.960
I will just appreciate how wonderful
an ordinary life with Hatsumi can be.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:25.200
For now, it's okay.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:53.330
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:59.760
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:07.230
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:14.060
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:21.900
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:29.230
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:35.730
...won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:44.760
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:51.400
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.360 --> 00:23:00.300
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:08.730
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:13.960
I will go there, praying.

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:18.100
Hazuki, you should
just love me instead!

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:19.330
Hmph!

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:22.060
Let's take a look
at the next book!

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:50.660
Next Time: Fujihime

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:53.630
Next Time: Fujihime
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler.

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:56.260
Please enjoy the next story as well.
